2:[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The Problem with Traditional To-Do Apps"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Todoist, Google Tasks, Microsoft To Do, Notion — they're all great at ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"recording"}]," tasks. But here's the uncomfortable truth: ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"none of them actually plan for you."}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["You open Todoist, stare at a blank screen, and think: ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"What should I do today?\""}]," Then you spend 20 minutes organizing tasks into categories, setting priorities, and adjusting deadlines. By the time you're done planning, you've already lost your best focus hours."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"This is the fundamental flaw of to-do apps: they make YOU do all the cognitive work."}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"How PlanBot is Different"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["PlanBot isn't a to-do app. It's an ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"AI planning assistant"}]," that does the thinking for you."]}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Feature"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Traditional To-Do Apps"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Plan Creation"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"You create every task manually"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"AI generates your entire daily plan"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time Allocation"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"You estimate and set times"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"AI optimizes time blocks based on your goals"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Priority Sorting"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"You drag and drop priorities"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"AI automatically prioritizes based on deadlines and importance"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Adaptation"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"You manually reschedule when things change"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"AI regenerates plans based on new inputs"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Motivation"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Basic checkboxes"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Streaks, XP, levels, and gamification"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Performance Insights"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"None or basic stats"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Weekly AI-generated performance reports"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Learning"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Same experience forever"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"AI learns your goal type and adapts recommendations"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Head-to-Head: PlanBot vs Popular Apps"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"PlanBot vs Todoist"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Todoist"}]," is excellent for task management — projects, labels, filters, natural language input. But Todoist doesn't tell you ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"what to do first"}],", ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"how long each task should take"}],", or ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"when to take breaks"}],". You still need to be your own project manager."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}]," eliminates this overhead. Tell the AI your goal (\"Prepare for GRE in 3 months\") and it generates a structured daily plan with study blocks, revision slots, and break optimization. Todoist records tasks; PlanBot creates them."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"PlanBot vs Google Tasks"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Google Tasks"}]," is the simplest option — great for grocery lists, not so great for JEE preparation. It has no AI, no gamification, no performance tracking. It's a digital notepad."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}]," brings intelligence. The AI understands that a JEE aspirant needs different scheduling than a working professional. Google Tasks treats every task the same; PlanBot treats every user differently."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"PlanBot vs Notion"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Notion"}]," is a powerhouse for knowledge management, databases, and collaboration. But its complexity is also its weakness — setting up a productivity system in Notion takes hours, and maintaining it takes constant effort."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}]," requires zero setup. Download → tell the AI your goal → get a plan. No templates to configure, no databases to design, no workflows to maintain."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why AI Planning Wins for Goal-Oriented People"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"1. Reduced Decision Fatigue"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Every decision you make depletes your mental energy. Choosing what to study, when to exercise, how long to work — these micro-decisions add up. AI eliminates them by making optimal choices for you."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"2. Evidence-Based Time Blocking"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"PlanBot's AI doesn't just randomly assign times. It uses principles of cognitive science — scheduling difficult tasks during peak energy, inserting strategic breaks, and avoiding task-switching — to create scientifically optimized schedules."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"3. Accountability Through Gamification"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"To-do apps have a fundamental accountability problem: nothing happens when you skip a task. PlanBot's streak system creates real stakes. Your 45-day streak is on the line, and that psychological pressure actually works."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"4. Continuous Improvement"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"With weekly AI reports (Elite and God tiers), PlanBot tracks your patterns over time and provides data-driven suggestions. No to-do app does this."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Which App Should You Use?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Use PlanBot if you:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Have specific goals (exams, fitness, business)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Struggle with planning and procrastination"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Want AI to do the scheduling work"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Respond well to gamification and streaks"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Want a \"set it and forget it\" planning experience"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Use Todoist/Notion if you:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Need complex project management with teams"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Prefer full manual control over every detail"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Already have an established planning system that works"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The best combo:"}]," Use PlanBot for daily AI planning + Notion for long-term knowledge management."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Can PlanBot replace Todoist completely?"}],"\nA: For personal daily planning, yes. For team project management with shared boards and labels, Todoist is still better. PlanBot is designed for individual goal achievement."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Is PlanBot available on web/desktop?"}],"\nA: PlanBot is currently Android only. This website shares tips and guides. Download the app to use PlanBot's AI planning features."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: What AI models does PlanBot use?"}],"\nA: PlanBot uses progressively more powerful AI engines across its tiers — Basic AI (Free), Standard AI (Pro), Advanced AI (Elite), and Premium AI (God) — each delivering increasingly refined planning."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: How much does PlanBot cost compared to Todoist Pro?"}],"\nA: Todoist Pro costs ₹333/month. PlanBot Pro starts at ₹99/month with AI planning, no ads, and a more capable AI engine. PlanBot's God tier (₹249/month) includes unlimited AI plans with the most powerful AI."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","em",null,{"children":["Want to experience AI-powered planning? ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","children":"Download PlanBot free"}]," on Android and create your first AI-generated daily plan in seconds."]}]}]]
